    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Protection sphere, War sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> While an ally is within the area of one of your wards, you may rally that ally. When you rally an ally who has an aegis you created attached to them, you may sacrifice an aegis to reduce the spell point cost of the rally by 1 spell point.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/protection#toc111\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
